---
// ASSESS artifact — not an app mock. The pitch is the output itself:
// a formative quiz, its answer key, and a flashcard, laid out like
// handouts on a teacher's desk.
---

<div class="qa-stage" aria-label="A formative quiz, its answer key, and a flashcard drafted by Buddy">

  <!-- The quiz handout -->
  <article class="qa-sheet">
    <header class="qa-sheet-head">
      <h4 class="qa-title">Photosynthesis — Check for Understanding</h4>
      <span class="qa-std">NGSS MS-LS1-6</span>
    </header>
    <p class="qa-meta">Grade 8 · Formative · 10 min</p>

    <ol class="qa-questions">
      <li>
        <p>Name the two products of photosynthesis.</p>
        <span class="qa-bloom qa-bloom--recall">Recall</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>A plant sits in a dark closet for a week. Predict what happens to its mass, and why.</p>
        <span class="qa-bloom qa-bloom--apply">Apply</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>A student claims plants get their food from the soil. What question would you ask to test their thinking?</p>
        <span class="qa-bloom qa-bloom--analyze">Analyze</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </article>

  <!-- The answer key -->
  <aside class="qa-key">
    <span class="qa-key-label">Answer key</span>
    <ol class="qa-key-list">
      <li>Glucose and oxygen.</li>
      <li>Mass drops — no light, no glucose.</li>
      <li>Look for: food is made from air and light.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-key-warn">
      <strong>Watch for:</strong> “plants eat soil.” Glucose comes from CO₂ and light — not the soil.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <!-- The flashcard deck -->
  <div class="qa-deck">
    <div class="qa-card qa-card--back-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="qa-card qa-card--back-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="qa-card">
      <span class="qa-card-label">Flashcards · 1 / 12</span>
      <p class="qa-card-q">Where does a plant's mass come from?</p>
      <span class="qa-card-hint">tap to reveal</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .qa-stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    container-type: size;
  }

  /* ---------- quiz handout ---------- */
  .qa-sheet {
    position: absolute;
    left: 7%;
    top: 8%;
    width: 42%;
    transform: rotate(-1.4deg);
    font-size: clamp(10px, 1.35cqw, 16px);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper-raised), var(--paper-base));
    border-radius: 0.6em;
    padding: 1.8em 2em;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
  }

  .qa-sheet-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1em;
  }

  .qa-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25em;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--paper-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .qa-std {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background-color: var(--accent-weak);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.35em 0.9em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .qa-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66em;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--paper-ink-weak);
    margin: 0.7em 0 0 0;
    padding-bottom: 1em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-border);
  }

  .qa-questions {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: qa;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .qa-questions li {
    counter-increment: qa;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.1em 0 0 1.9em;
  }

  .qa-questions li + li {
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--paper-border);
    margin-top: 1.1em;
  }

  .qa-questions li::before {
    content: counter(qa) ".";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.1em;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  .qa-questions p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95em;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--paper-ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.6em 0;
  }

  .qa-bloom {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.32em 0.95em;
  }

  .qa-bloom--recall {
    color: #075985;
    background-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.14);
  }

  .qa-bloom--apply {
    color: #166534;
    background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.16);
  }

  .qa-bloom--analyze {
    color: #5b21b6;
    background-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.16);
  }

  /* ---------- answer key ---------- */
  .qa-key {
    position: absolute;
    left: 46%;
    top: 34%;
    width: 27.5%;
    transform: rotate(1.6deg);
    z-index: 3;
    font-size: clamp(9.5px, 1.2cqw, 14px);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper-raised), var(--paper-base));
    border-radius: 0.6em;
    padding: 1.5em 1.7em;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
  }

  .qa-key-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.35em;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }

  .qa-key-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 1.3em;
  }

  .qa-key-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--paper-ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.45em;
  }

  .qa-key-warn {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.76em;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background-color: var(--accent-weak);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-border);
    border-radius: 0.3em;
    padding: 0.7em 0.9em;
    margin: 1em 0 0 0;
  }

  .qa-key-warn strong {
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  /* ---------- flashcard deck ---------- */
  .qa-deck {
    position: absolute;
    left: 77%;
    top: 24%;
    width: 19%;
    font-size: clamp(9px, 1.15cqw, 14px);
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .qa-sheet {
      left: var(--space-6);
      width: 44%;
    }
    .qa-key {
      left: 48%;
      width: 28%;
    }
    .qa-deck {
      left: 78%;
      width: 20%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .qa-stage {
      background: transparent !important;
    }
    .qa-sheet {
      left: var(--space-5);
      width: 44%;
    }
    .qa-key {
      left: 36%;
      width: 28%;
    }
    .qa-deck {
      left: 50%;
      width: 20%;
    }
  }

  .qa-card {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--chrome-panel), var(--chrome-sunken));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-base);
    border-radius: 0.8em;
    padding: 1.4em 1.4em 1.2em;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-overlay);
  }

  .qa-card--back-1,
  .qa-card--back-2 {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .qa-card--back-1 {
    transform: rotate(-3deg) translateY(6%);
  }

  .qa-card--back-2 {
    transform: rotate(-6.5deg) translateY(12%);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .qa-card-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }

  .qa-card-q {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.98em;
    font-weight: 510;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--fg-strong);
    margin: 0 0 1.4em 0;
  }

  .qa-card-hint {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.56em;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--fg-weak);
  }
</style>
